@host = http://localhost:5226

### All makes
GET {{host}}/api/makes

### Supported model years
GET {{host}}/api/model-years

### Vehicle types for Honda (474)
GET {{host}}/api/makes/474/vehicle-types

### Honda models for 2015
GET {{host}}/api/makes/474/models?year=2015

### Honda passenger cars for 2015
GET {{host}}/api/makes/474/models?year=2015&vehicleType=Passenger%20Car

### Validation error: year out of range
GET {{host}}/api/makes/474/models?year=1900
